# Judge Magister Gabranth (2/2 menace): "Whenever another creature or artifact you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on" it. Turn 1 Bot1 casts it with a Mons's Goblin
# Raiders and a Memnite. On turn 2 Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Raiders (a creature, 3/3) and its Shatter destroys Bot1's Mox Jet (an artifact that is no creature, 4/4).
# Bot2 casts its own Memnite there too, and on turn 3 Bot1's Lightning Bolt kills it: an opponent's creature and artifact, so Gabranth stays 4/4.

